#: ../../source/reference/extensions.rst:4
msgid "Extension APIs"
msgstr "扩展 API"

#: ../../source/reference/extensions.rst:7
msgid "Accessor registration"
msgstr "访问器注册"

#: ../../source/reference/extensions.rst:9
msgid ""
"Custom accessor namespaces are registered through the ``api`` package of "
"the data type they belong to. Those modules are shortcuts onto the "
"registrators defined in the data-type core modules, next to the type "
"tuples they install on; the registry itself and ``register_accessor`` "
"(the generic entry point taking an arbitrary class tuple) live in "
"``maxframe.core.accessor``."
msgstr ""
"自定义访问器命名空间通过其所属数据类型的 ``api`` 包注册。这些模块是"
"数据类型 core 模块中注册函数的快捷入口，注册函数与它们所安装的 type tuple"
" 放在一起；注册表本身以及 ``register_accessor``（接受任意类元组的通用入口"
"）位于 ``maxframe.core.accessor``。"

#: ../../source/reference/extensions.rst:15
msgid ""
"An accessor is an ordinary class that is instantiated with the object the"
" attribute was read from, following the pandas convention: it raises "
"``AttributeError`` from ``__init__`` when the object is not supported."
msgstr ""
"访问器是普通类，实例化时传入读取该属性的对象，遵循 pandas 约定：当对象不"
"受支持时，在 ``__init__`` 中抛出 ``AttributeError``。"

